393 Shipping Logs and Monitoring Containers
You'll have three main components:
The Elastic Stack (Elasticsearch, Kibana, Elastic Agent)
The Node.js API that generates web logs
The Ruby worker that emits periodic background logs
Step 2 – Creating the Node.js API
